    "name": "Into A Hearth Yonder",
    "steam_appid": 3636510,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/958fe7389dd16eb484516a128b67e3d6.poster.avif?t=1745489866\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/958fe7389dd16eb484516a128b67e3d6.webm?t=1745489866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/958fe7389dd16eb484516a128b67e3d6.mp4?t=1745489866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Craft. Explore. Befriend.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viteria is a hand-crafted island, built like a living puzzle - brimming with secrets, resources, and challenges across its diverse biomes. Explore it your way: gather exotic materials, craft powerful gear, build your workshop, and shape your own path through combat, farming, puzzle-solving, and more. Whether braving distant peaks or decorating your perfect home, every action helps you master the art of creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that\u2019s just the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/6a5a6d78ede3754a257524691e3622d5.poster.avif?t=1745489866\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/6a5a6d78ede3754a257524691e3622d5.webm?t=1745489866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/6a5a6d78ede3754a257524691e3622d5.mp4?t=1745489866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT AND COMMAND AUTOMATA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered across the island are charming mechanical creatures called <i>automata</i>. Each one offers unique benefits\u2014boosting your combat, enhancing crafting, or unlocking new puzzle solutions. Track them down, bond with them, and build your perfect team.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Automaton is Unique</strong> \u2013 Over 50 (for starters) to discover through quests, exploration, events, and challenges. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Swarm</strong> \u2013 Equip up to five at a time while others rest at your home base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Playstyle</strong> \u2013 Slot automata into gear or stations to gain passive bonuses and new abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up and Fuse</strong> \u2013 Strengthen automata over time or fuse them together for powerful hybrids with game-changing effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover Their Origins</strong> \u2013 As your collection grows, unlock special quests that reveal the truth behind these mysterious beings\u2014and earn rare modifiers and cosmetics along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/7b910fc58c36fd9205e9c10a5a6859ae.poster.avif?t=1745489866\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/7b910fc58c36fd9205e9c10a5a6859ae.webm?t=1745489866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/7b910fc58c36fd9205e9c10a5a6859ae.mp4?t=1745489866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD FULL OF SECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From lush valleys to frozen coasts, Viteria is a world designed for discovery. Craft gadgets and gear to reach distant corners, solve environmental puzzles, and uncover ancient structures, hidden treasures, and mysterious landmarks. With the right tools \u2014 and a few teleport potions\u2014you can go anywhere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTERS THAT STICK WITH YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a colorful cast of islanders with their own quests, personalities, and peculiar challenges. Some are funny, some are quirky, and some are surprisingly heartfelt. From cute encounters, like playing hide-and-seek with a talking bush, to the touching stories of untangling the feud between two powerful siblings, every encounter adds to the island\u2019s deeper story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY, TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go solo or join friends in seamless co-op. Share loot within range, complete multiplayer challenges for special rewards, and show off your rarest finds\u2014from automata combos to custom outfits. The more you team up, the more you benefit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/5d6ec27aa0782ea4cb1b95adc9dd675a.poster.avif?t=1745489866\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/5d6ec27aa0782ea4cb1b95adc9dd675a.webm?t=1745489866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/5d6ec27aa0782ea4cb1b95adc9dd675a.mp4?t=1745489866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A LIVING, GROWING WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure doesn\u2019t end at launch. Major post-release updates (in our mind and with your feedback) will introduce new biomes, quests, and automata in an episodic format you can enjoy at your own pace\u2014plus regular seasonal content to keep the world fresh and full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/958fe7389dd16eb484516a128b67e3d6.poster.avif?t=1745489866\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/958fe7389dd16eb484516a128b67e3d6.webm?t=1745489866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/958fe7389dd16eb484516a128b67e3d6.mp4?t=1745489866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Craft. Explore. Befriend.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viteria is a hand-crafted island, built like a living puzzle - brimming with secrets, resources, and challenges across its diverse biomes. Explore it your way: gather exotic materials, craft powerful gear, build your workshop, and shape your own path through combat, farming, puzzle-solving, and more. Whether braving distant peaks or decorating your perfect home, every action helps you master the art of creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But that\u2019s just the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/6a5a6d78ede3754a257524691e3622d5.poster.avif?t=1745489866\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/6a5a6d78ede3754a257524691e3622d5.webm?t=1745489866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/6a5a6d78ede3754a257524691e3622d5.mp4?t=1745489866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COLLECT AND COMMAND AUTOMATA</stro