ECRETS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From lush valleys to frozen coasts, Viteria is a world designed for discovery. Craft gadgets and gear to reach distant corners, solve environmental puzzles, and uncover ancient structures, hidden treasures, and mysterious landmarks. With the right tools \u2014 and a few teleport potions\u2014you can go anywhere.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTERS THAT STICK WITH YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a colorful cast of islanders with their own quests, personalities, and peculiar challenges. Some are funny, some are quirky, and some are surprisingly heartfelt. From cute encounters, like playing hide-and-seek with a talking bush, to the touching stories of untangling the feud between two powerful siblings, every encounter adds to the island\u2019s deeper story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY YOUR WAY, TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go solo or join friends in seamless co-op. Share loot within range, complete multiplayer challenges for special rewards, and show off your rarest finds\u2014from automata combos to custom outfits. The more you team up, the more you benefit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/5d6ec27aa0782ea4cb1b95adc9dd675a.poster.avif?t=1745489866\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/5d6ec27aa0782ea4cb1b95adc9dd675a.webm?t=1745489866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/5d6ec27aa0782ea4cb1b95adc9dd675a.mp4?t=1745489866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A LIVING, GROWING WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure doesn\u2019t end at launch. Major post-release updates (in our mind and with your feedback) will introduce new biomes, quests, and automata in an episodic format you can enjoy at your own pace\u2014plus regular seasonal content to keep the world fresh and full of surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
